      <dict>
        <key>anchorPolicy</key>
        <string>Retain the genuine Lato psili shape and its optical horizontal attachment relation. Place its lower ink at the same-cut native comma-above lower-ink height. Use the actual native Cyrillic above/MKM input role y, and derive one receiving-stack role from the actual native acute ink-relative receiver. These new roles require actual candidate authentic-stack and clipping review.</string>
        <key>construction</key>
        <string>Normalise the genuine same-cut existing-parent psili outline from2000 to1000 UPM, then translate it without distortion into the measured native above-mark frame. Preserve genuine italic and weight-specific shape; add only explicit new attachment/receiving roles.</string>
